      "message": "Maybe we move this part of the code (from line 4052-4062) into domain_unmap and change it\u0027s prototype to return the size (of the successful unmap) instead of returning void. And also subsequently change the pkvm_domain_unmap\u0027s prototype.\n\nThis way, we can make an easy check in the starting of domain_unmap (line 4052-4059) that if the unmapping contains a partial overlap with a superpage, size 0 (or the expanded correct size) would be returned instead of doing a partial unmapping, which isn\u0027t exactly right. This would move the check from host to pkvm giving it more control.",
